# Runtime data
data/logs/
data/runs.json
output/

# chunks/ is FASB ASC 606 and KPMG handbook text -- copyrighted, so it is not
# redistributed here. data/rules.json is excluded for the same reason: since
# provenance was restored, each rule carries up to 2000 characters of that text
# in source_text, which makes the file ~2MB of the standard.
chunks/
data/rules.json

# ...but the rule set itself is the interesting artifact, and it is publishable
# once the regulation text is stripped. Produced by:
#   python extraction/backfill_provenance.py --export-redacted data/rules.public.json
!data/rules.public.json

